docs {
POST /api/v1/words/:id/view - catat view detail lemma (G6).
Publik, soft auth. Unik per pembaca per hari WIB.
Id asing / draft = no-op tetap 200.
Lihat juga POST /words/lemma/:lemma/view untuk URL web.
}

meta {
  name: Record Word View
  seq: 40
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/words/{{word_id}}/view
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  X-Device-Id: {{device_id}}
}

tests {
  test("200 no-op aman", () => {
    expect(res.status).to.equal(200);
    expect(res.body.success).to.equal(true);
    expect(res.body.data).to.equal(null);
  });
}
